
**Commandes GitHub :**

```bash
# 1. Crée le repo sur GitHub
gh repo create tokonomics-examples --public --description "Code examples for Tokonomics AI cost metering proxy" --clone

# 2. Entre dans le repo
cd tokonomics-examples

# 3. Copie le README (colle le contenu ci-dessus dans README.md)

# 4. Push
git add README.md
git commit -m "Initial commit — integration examples for Tokonomics"
git push origin main

# 5. Ajoute les topics
gh repo edit tokonomics-examples --add-topic llm-cost-tracking,ai-budgeting,openai,anthropic,deepseek,api-proxy
